# STL Complete Assembly - MALE
# Combined mesh: Skeleton + Organs + Muscles + Glue Channels
# Total Components: 206 bones + 79 organs + muscle groups
# Ready for multi-material 3D printing
# ASSEMBLY_INSTRUCTIONS:
#   1. Print skeleton in carbon-fiber reinforced polymer
#   2. Print organs in bio-compatible silicone gel
#   3. Print muscles in conductive TPU with magnet pockets
#   4. Inject glue into channel network
#   5. Assemble using magnetic alignment
